    LLM: "As the lone player, use the Dapp to strengthen your trump suit and eliminate short suits to allow ruffing.\n\nThe team should coordinate (without speaking) to force the lone player to waste high trumps and to 'smear' high-value cards into team tricks.\n\nCarefully track which trumps and high-value suit cards (Kings/Queens) have been played to determine when it is safe to lead high cards.",
